---
import { supplyRules } from '../data/druckers-business';
---
<section class="notice" aria-labelledby="availability-title">
  <h2 id="availability-title">Availability &amp; lead time</h2>
  <p>Listed products can be sourced on demand from Baddi, subject to confirmation after enquiry or order.</p>
  <ul>
    {supplyRules.availabilityStatuses.map((status) => <li>{status}</li>)}
  </ul>
  <p>{supplyRules.sameDayNote}</p>
  <p>{supplyRules.largerRequirementNote}.</p>
  <p>Exact availability, lead time and delivery are confirmed after your enquiry. Coverage and logistics charges are communicated on request.</p>
</section>
